smart.error.file_changed = Dosiye talilen yɛlɛmana Schist kɔkan. Mara tɔgɔ wɛrɛ la kɛ walasa k'i ka yɛlɛmaw mara, o kɔ Smart Object tali kokura walima Misali talilenw kuraya.
